                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">PRACTICE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">The five-part letter structure</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"200\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">1. VIVID SCENE</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"320\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"375\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">2. MORAL PIVOT</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"440\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"495\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">3. PERSONAL CONFESSION</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"560\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"615\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">4. PRACTICAL ADVICE</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"680\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"735\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">5. CLOSING QUOTE</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"820\" width=\"700\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"865\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Find the structure.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"895\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Find the lesson.</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Apply the structural method"
