                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">The unifying argument</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"200\" width=\"900\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">LETTER 12</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Each day a whole life</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"360\" width=\"900\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"415\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">LETTER 26</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"460\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Nightly examen and rehearsal</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"520\" width=\"900\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"575\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">LETTER 70</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"620\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Quality, not length</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"680\" width=\"900\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"735\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">LETTER 77</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"780\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">The shame test</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"850\" width=\"700\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Death rehearsed</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"940\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">= freedom won.</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Four letters, one curriculum"
