                  "explanation": "Belichick went **back to being an assistant** under Bill Parcells. From the outside, this looked like demotion. From his inside scorecard, it was continuity — the same standards, the same work, now with hard-won failure data to incorporate. Holiday's emphasis is that Belichick didn't reinvent himself, didn't change paths, didn't perform a comeback narrative. He kept executing the same disciplines. The dynasty 5+ years later was built on the unchanged inside scorecard.",
                  "visual": {
                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">What Belichick did after the firing</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"220\" width=\"900\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">RETURNED TO ASSISTANT</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Under Parcells. Same disciplines.</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Failure data now incorporated.</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Looked like demotion. Was continuity.</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"500\" width=\"900\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"555\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">NO REINVENTION</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"605\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">No media job. No memoir.</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"645\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">No comeback performance.</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"685\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Just the work, restarted.</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"760\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"815\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">DYNASTY FOLLOWED — BECAUSE OF, NOT DESPITE</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"865\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">The unchanged inside scorecard</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"905\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">built the foundation 5 years before the wins.</text>\n                </svg>",
                    "caption": "Continuity, not comeback"
                  }
