                  "explanation": "The capstone is explicit: the **lifetime companion document** — your private inside scorecard with its eight sections — is the seminar's most valuable artifact. Holiday's whole framework points to this kind of internal, structured, ongoing record as the practical defense against ego. A personal brand, a quote, a signed book — these are outside-scorecard artifacts. The real artifact is private, structured, maintained, and integrates everything the seminar has taught into one document you use for decades.",
